Source: pxvirt-isoinfo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Lierfang Support Team <itsupport@lierfang.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/jiangcuo/pxvirt-isoinfo
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: pxvirt-isoinfo
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Detect the operating system on installation images
 Reads ISO 9660 (with Joliet and Rock Ridge) and UDF images without mounting
 them and reports the operating system, version, architecture and installer
 as JSON. For Windows images the editions in install.wim/install.esd are
 listed.
 .
 Linux distributions are detected with rules from
 /usr/share/pxvirt-isoinfo/rules.json, local rules can be added in
 /etc/pxvirt-isoinfo/rules.d/.
